#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:1
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:3
msgid ""
"A minimal end-to-end run: simulate data with `cnets`, then infer a tree from"
" it with `cnetml`."
msgstr "一个最简的完整示例：先用 `cnets` 模拟数据，再用 `cnetml` 从中推断树。"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:6
msgid "1. Build"
msgstr "1. 构建"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:12
msgid ""
"The three executables land in `bin/` at the top of the repository, next to "
"the `run-*.sh` driver scripts. See [Installation](../installation/index.md) "
"for HPC targets."
msgstr ""
"三个可执行文件生成在仓库顶层的 `bin/` 中，和 `run-*.sh` 运行脚本放在一起。HPC "
"上的构建见[安装](../installation/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:16
msgid "2. Simulate a small dataset"
msgstr "2. 模拟一个小数据集"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:18
msgid "From the top of the repository:"
msgstr "在仓库顶层目录运行："

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:24
msgid ""
"Edit the parameter block at the top of the script rather than passing flags "
"by hand. The defaults simulate `Ns=3` tumour regions plus the normal sample,"
" using the haplotype-specific model (`model=2`), `cn_max=4`, with only "
"duplication/deletion events (`r3=r4=r5=0`, i.e. no chromosome gain/loss or "
"WGD). Output goes to `./example/`."
msgstr ""
"修改脚本顶部的参数块，而不是手动传参数。默认设置模拟 `Ns=3` 个肿瘤区域加一个正常样本，使用 haplotype-specific "
"模型（`model=2`），`cn_max=4`，只有 duplication/deletion 事件（`r3=r4=r5=0`，即没有染色体 "
"gain/loss 和 WGD）。输出写到 `./example/`。"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:30
msgid ""
"Settings shared by all three scripts — the output directory and the random "
"seed — are in `config/common.conf`. The environment overrides the file, so "
"for a one-off change set a variable on the command line instead, e.g. "
"`CNETA_SEED=42 bin/run-cnets.sh`:"
msgstr ""
"三个脚本共用的设置（输出目录和随机种子）在 `config/common.conf` "
"中。环境变量优先于该文件，所以只想临时改一次时，可以在命令行上设变量，例如 `CNETA_SEED=42 bin/run-cnets.sh`："

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:35
msgid ""
"`CNETA_OUT` — the output directory (default `./example`, relative to where "
"you run the script)"
msgstr "`CNETA_OUT`：输出目录（默认 `./example`，相对于运行脚本时所在的目录）"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:37
msgid ""
"`CNETA_SEED` — the random seed; set it to reproduce a run (default: a new "
"random seed each run, recorded at the top of the log and in `seed-"
"history.txt` in the output directory)"
msgstr ""
"`CNETA_SEED`：随机种子，设定后可重现一次运行（默认每次运行使用新的随机种子，记录在日志开头和输出目录的 `seed-history.txt`"
" 中）"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:40
msgid "`CNETA_BIN` — where the executables live (default `bin/`)"
msgstr "`CNETA_BIN`：可执行文件所在目录（默认 `bin/`）"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:41
msgid "`CNETA_CONFIG_DIR` — where the configuration files live (default `config/`)"
msgstr "`CNETA_CONFIG_DIR`：配置文件所在目录（默认 `config/`）"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:42
msgid ""
"`CNETA_CONFIG` — `run-cnetmcmc.sh` only: its config file (default "
"`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`)"
msgstr "`CNETA_CONFIG`：仅 `run-cnetmcmc.sh` 使用，指定其配置文件（默认 `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`）"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:45
msgid "See [Configuration](../configuration/index.md) for more."
msgstr "更多内容见[配置](../configuration/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:47
msgid "3. Infer a tree"
msgstr "3. 推断树"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:53
msgid ""
"By default this reads `./example/sim-data-1-cn.txt.gz` — note the matching "
"`prefix=sim-data-1` at the top of the script. If you changed the prefix (or "
"left it empty) in `run-cnets.sh`, update `prefix` here to match. `mode=0` "
"(the default) runs maximum-likelihood tree search."
msgstr ""
"默认读取 `./example/sim-data-1-cn.txt.gz`，对应脚本顶部的 `prefix=sim-data-1`。如果在 `run-"
"cnets.sh` 中改了前缀（或留空），这里的 `prefix` 也要相应修改。`mode=0`（默认）执行最大似然树搜索。"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:58
msgid "4. Understand the outputs"
msgstr "4. 理解输出"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:60
msgid ""
"`run-cnets.sh` writes `*-cn.txt.gz` (simulated copy numbers), `*-tree.txt` /"
" `*-tree.nex` (the true tree), and `*-info.txt` / `*-mut.txt` (mutations per"
" branch) into `./example/`."
msgstr ""
"`run-cnets.sh` 在 `./example/` 中写出 `*-cn.txt.gz`（模拟的拷贝数）、`*-tree.txt` / "
"`*-tree.nex`（真实的树）和 `*-info.txt` / `*-mut.txt`（各分支上的突变）。"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:64
msgid ""
"`run-cnetml.sh` writes the reconstructed tree to `MaxL-<suffix>.txt` in the "
"same directory, plus a `std_cnetml_<suffix>` log file — check it for `cnetml"
" main run SUCCEEDED` or `FAILED`."
msgstr ""
"`run-cnetml.sh` 把重建的树写到同一目录下的 `MaxL-<suffix>.txt`，另有日志文件 "
"`std_cnetml_<suffix>`，可以在其中查看 `cnetml main run SUCCEEDED` 或 `FAILED`。"

#: ../../source/quickstart/index.md:68
msgid ""
"See [File formats](../file-formats/index.md) for the column-level detail of "
"each file, and the [User guide](../user-guide/index.md) for every option "
"`cnets` and `cnetml` accept."
msgstr ""
"每个文件各列的含义见[文件格式](../file-formats/index.md)；`cnets` 和 `cnetml` 的全部参数见[使用指南"
"](../user-guide/index.md)。"

